<title>POLAND: RAFAKO OCT NET RISES TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO OCT NET RISES TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.98 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.98 vs   4.01</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.76 vs   4.54</p>
<p> Sales		   33.40 vs  31.30</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.88 vs  17.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.88 vs  27.41</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.48 vs  33.06</p>
<p> Sales		  322.69 vs 301.22</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial boiler maker is</p>
<p>Fabryka Kotlow Rafako SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
